Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《牺牲之剑》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sura\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the Romans came …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为再也看不到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}never thought see her again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 我会永远和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will always be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,神也不能把我从你身边带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even the gods I would take your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.09,0:01:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们敢试的话 我就把他们全杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would kill all if they tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带到澡堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them to the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.39,0:02:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他妈的先把头发剪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before we cut these hairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.56,0:03:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,泳池干了 是呀 我们需要雨水\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tank is empty. Yes, we need rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,用钱就能让它装满水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Money also would fill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也需要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need it too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新宠物怎么样？活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is your new puppy? Breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,用掉的钱可以让泳池装满一个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the money paid for it would fill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用太多的钱了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the tank for a month. Spent too much …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,物有所值 Lucretia 斯巴达克斯只是个活死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I paid my worth, Lucretia. Spartacus is an undead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.75,0:03:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他死之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long until he dies, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多久你才能拿回你的投资？\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking with him your investment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就要完成他的使命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not before he achieve their goals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Claudius Glaber副将给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do Legadus Claudius glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的目的是什么？和我希望的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are his intentions? Similar to what I expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要来 两天内\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will come here. In two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来的意图不明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reason for the visit unclear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是意思很明显 他要来谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, but the meaning is Clearly, he has to thank me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了色雷斯人付了太多钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since they paid more expensive the Thracian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.24,0:04:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Glaber试图在竞技场杀了他 斯巴达克斯逃过一劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus escaped the attempt glaber to assassinate him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.97,0:04:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们想要让他自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people asked for his release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让副将很为难\N{\fnArial\fs30}That left in an embarrassing situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提议买下他 两全其美\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you buy it, I offering an alternative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是价格虚高了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a high price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果斯巴达克斯渎了神还能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Spartacus survive the oath{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.55,0:04:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技场会是他的坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}the arena will be your grave it should have been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.44,0:04:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not survive …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.58,0:04:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他早一点死副将会很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}His death will be a pleasure premature for the Legadus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.83,0:04:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔 欲望还蛮高涨的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wishes of both be satisfied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一点帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a little help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,副将简单的感谢不足够\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple gesture of gratitude the Legadus not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.95,0:04:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要他的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we want is his support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能更少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No less than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,副将会是我们的施主\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Legadus as our benefactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的钱会让我们的泳池满到溢出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coins will fill it reservoir to overflowing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要准备一个宴会 是的 但是小型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will make a feast. Yes, but small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有酒有水 很多水\N{\fnArial\fs30}With wine and water, of water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.97,0:05:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够让舌头湿润了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just enough … to wet the tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会献祭一头牛让天神保佑我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacrifice a bull to have the favor of the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来只小一点的嘛 …\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe something smaller …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.17,0:05:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一头羊吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sheep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,献给众神 愿他们保佑我们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bless us lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这头他妈的的猪还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother fucker … damn that pig still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是斯巴达克斯 大家都在谈论的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him. The Spartacus who everyone is talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我名字是… 没有人关心你曾经是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is … No one cares who did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在是谁我也不在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not give a damn for who he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？来生 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place? Life after death, friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者至少是在它生锈的门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least the outside rusty gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:07:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是Batiatus的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a guest honored now Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡普阿伟大的Ludus的拥有者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owner of great Ludus de Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ludus？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ludus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}School training, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,将男人转变为天神的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where men are transformed into gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液是他们的甜浆 竞技场是他们的巅峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood is the nectar of them. And the arena is the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,最真的兄弟情谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most true brotherhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来几天你和其它新丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survive the coming days …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.49,0:07:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,会成为我们的一分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you and the other recruits may live among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,会被烙上这个烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}And receive our brand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们能给你一点东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, we offer something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物 水 也许脚底的一些香油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food, water. Maybe oil fragrant for your feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙反应太慢 是不是？对色雷斯人你还期待什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is slow, is not it? What expect from a Thracian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来像一坨新鲜的狗屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells like shit fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.16,0:08:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 除了他们女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone. Except their wives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来都像尿 还有狗屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}They smell of … piss. And shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, what is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是高卢人 小子 最优秀的人种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a Frenchman, kid. The best of my race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus 打不败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus, the undefeated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,高卢人 这就解释了你为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Frenchman. This explains why …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.60,0:08:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来像女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}smells like woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的伤口 吃饭吧 好好休息去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of your wounds. Eat, rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有力气的时候 我们再来谈这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}When retrieving the forces … back to that conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,弱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weak! Weak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群狗屎 都没鸡巴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of shit. It should not stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你应该加入他们 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you should join them, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.69,0:10:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们脚底下是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's underneath your feet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.94,0:10:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们脚底下是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's underneath your feet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus 你脚底是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus, which is underneath your feet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,神圣的土地 导师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy ground, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,被泪水和鲜血浇灌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bathed in tears blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的眼泪 你们的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your tears, your blood, pathetic lives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群可悲的生命 要百炼才能成钢\N{\fnArial\fs30}forged into something of value.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好听 好好学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, learn, and maybe live …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能作为角斗士活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}as gladiators!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 注意听你们主人的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, pay attention on his master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经被保佑了 所有这里的每一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were blessed, each one of you …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里找到自己 Quintus Lentulus Batiatus的Ludus学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}for being here in Ludus Quintus Lentulus Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为共和国准备最优秀的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}That comes from the best all the gladiators!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在接下来的日子里证明自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove value in the difficult days ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是个普通的奴隶 不仅仅是个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stems are more than slaves, more than men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败 就是死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fail and die …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.09,0:11:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在这里或者被卖去挖煤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well where they are or will be sent to the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功 骄傲地站在我太阳神的余晖下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Triumph and stand up proud with my Titans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.99,0:11:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus！Batiatus！Batiatus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus! Batiatus! Batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为角斗士 他不害怕死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gladiator … not fear death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拥抱它 爱抚它\N{\fnArial\fs30}He embraces, caresses …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:11:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,操它\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他每次进入竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each time he enters arena …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.81,0:12:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把他的鸡巴放入野兽的嘴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He puts his cock the mouth of the beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷在它嘴巴闭上之前 他能回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pray to return home before her mouth shut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群狗没有一个能坚持一会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of you dogs last a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个可悲的色雷斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sad piece of Thracian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,被判了死刑 只有一把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}survived against four men in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在竞技场打败了四个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sentenced to death. With nothing but a sword to trust your life.{\r}
