Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次 一次又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again, again and again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.21,0:13:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他战胜了死亡 信念还有众神\N{\fnArial\fs30}He defied death, the fate and the gods themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须看看这个人 好好研究他 然后发现…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must see this man, study it and understand …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他其实什么也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.47,0:13:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个懦夫 一个辅助部队的逃兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A coward, a deserter auxiliary troops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在竞技场的胜利和他的勇气一样空洞无力\N{\fnArial\fs30}His victory in the arena was as empty as his courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.01,0:13:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打败了Solonius未经训练的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fought against men poorly trained Solonius, {\r}
