Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他和这里任何一个角斗士进入竞技场的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it had entered the arena any gladiator here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.59,0:13:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的人头早就落地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}his head would not have been from your body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个色雷斯人不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thracian disagrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.18,0:14:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许来个证明吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demonstration, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.77,0:14:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,练习剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swords of training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明我们是错的 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove us wrong, Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,捡起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字 你的人生 由我们来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name, your life, is what we decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这个懦夫需要一点优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the coward wants some advantage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来让发抖的脚停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stop shaking knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cledius\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cledius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人我无能为力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can not do anything with this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他送到矿井去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send him to the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很急 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We seem in a hurry, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.61,0:16:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻必须有合适的立足点\N{\fnArial\fs30}An attack must be made the right foundation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在身体恢复平衡前得给人施加点压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tends to push before winning balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.99,0:16:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.59,0:17:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,允许在你背部占有优势 你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let advantage on his back and you will be condemned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.43,0:17:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟比你强大的对手缠斗 你就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Test forces with an opponent more powerful and will be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.19,0:18:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在竞技场再甩一次剑 你就再死一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw your sword into the arena and you'll be dead again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.32,0:18:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的愚蠢让他丧了命\N{\fnArial\fs30}His folly has cost a life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的命还没有赎完罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But its still can be redeemed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,举两个手指 投降的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two fingers. A sign of redemption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求占绝对上风的人宽容\N{\fnArial\fs30}A plea for mercy responsible for the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,求我们饶命呀 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg for your life rabbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.35,0:18:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人 继续训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus. Keep your workout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他试图杀害你最好的角斗士 你却让他活着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to kill his best man and you let him live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Glaber明天到访\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glaber visit us tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有意让这个色雷斯人生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}His intentions with the Thracian include blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他满意之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and until they are satisfied{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得让他活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to keep it warm and flowing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.75,0:19:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,神呀 太热了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, it's hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头到舌跟沸腾了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boiling language and the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.55,0:20:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屁都不是的奴隶和罪犯 大部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slaves of shit and criminals. Many of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们比较好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are best?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.15,0:21:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在执刑时活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survived their implementation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次 加上那个高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice, counting that the Gaul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没把你头塞进沙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}not present their brains to the sand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're from a different source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.37,0:21:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,比这群倒霉鬼强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Above this band of unfortunates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Varro\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.11,0:21:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,最惨的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由人 自作孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}A free man, sentenced by their own hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么有人自愿来做这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why condemn a man voluntarily to that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些小债\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some small debts …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,利滚利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还钱很困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay them was difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.93,0:21:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一担心的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only affects me …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有家人？老婆和小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have family? Wifeand child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.25,0:21:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在竞技场呆两年 赢了钱让他们生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}2 years in the arena, and my earnings to sustain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.77,0:22:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你打得好的话 有钱奖赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you fight well, is rewarded in cash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.60,0:22:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,够还钱的了 如果众神眷顾的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to pay my debts, if the gods want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gods …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真笨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.00,0:22:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,经鉴定还是个好伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in good company, it seems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.75,0:22:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我目前能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the best I can now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.31,0:22:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一两个还有希望 但其它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}1 or 2 promising but other{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.09,0:22:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈都不会把他们送到竞技场来 你没妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}my mother would not send the arena. You have no mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.43,0:22:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她生你下就抛弃你了 这就是为什么我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left the cunt beyond, why is my favorite!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有更好的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No better offer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.39,0:22:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,更好的 是呀 但就我的钱来说 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better, yes, that fits in my pocket, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.48,0:22:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站出来质疑和抱怨 而不是去做好你的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is challenging and demanding instead of devoting themselves to the task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.34,0:22:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不仅效忠你Batiatus 还有Ludus\N{\fnArial\fs30}I insist only to honor him, Batiatus, and this Ludus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.08,0:22:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Glaber副将明天到访\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Legadus glaber come tomorrow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.60,0:22:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着让他重建的愿景\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with him hope best of luck, until then{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.91,0:22:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此之前 我只能负担得起这些废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}these men are what I pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.75,0:22:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们训练好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn them into rocks …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.23,0:22:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就把他们丢到矿里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}or throw them in the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.82,0:22:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意愿 我来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}His will, my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.72,0:22:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ovidius 抱歉有事耽搁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ovidius, I apologize the delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.60,0:22:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在钱的份上 原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I accept the apology currencies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.32,0:23:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,3个月的粮食 钱还没付呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}3 months of grains payments are late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.65,0:23:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,3个月 是吗？到今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}3? Really? Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vulcanalia的比赛就要举行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kits Vulcanalia are coming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.88,0:23:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到时候可以还钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be extended debt by then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.69,0:23:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,本金上涨30% 30%\N{\fnArial\fs30}The debt-most 30%."Thirty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.22,0:23:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不现在还钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or pay the debt now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.88,0:23:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vulcanalia之后本金上涨30%\N{\fnArial\fs30}The debt plus 30% after Vulcanalia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.51,0:23:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.09,0:23:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以打败他 Crixus？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could beat him. Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.79,0:23:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会被打得屁滚尿流\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have shit all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.67,0:23:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会惨到那个地步 他妈的像狗一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would not have finished on the floor fucked like a dog!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.15,0:23:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有训练 那个高卢人 可以打败我们随便哪个 Kerza\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without training, the Gaul defeat all of us, Kerze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.91,0:24:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲其它就没意义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To say otherwise is nonsense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷最后测试里不要遇到Crixus\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray not face Crixus the final test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.48,0:24:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 你走不了那么远 混小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not worry, not come so far, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.09,0:24:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都能参加测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone can get the test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.57,0:24:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And beyond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.23,0:24:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.82,0:24:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 如果打得好的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, to fight well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.24,0:24:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.98,0:24:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你拿钱的话 你不能选择自由的 Varro\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worthless if you have money, Varro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.04,0:24:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢得竞技场观众的心 你两样都可得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Win the hearts of audiences the arena and will have both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.65,0:24:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那和角斗士打过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fought with the gladiators there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们的机率有多大？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are our chances?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.43,0:24:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}All will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.25,0:24:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.01,0:24:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 证明自己是男人之后再睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep when they prove are men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.99,0:25:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue to march.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.12,0:25:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.65,0:25:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.82,0:25:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去你的梦乡吧 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to your dreams. In a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.58,0:25:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更好的酒 我们需要很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need better wine. We need several things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.67,0:25:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会重新得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we will again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.01,0:25:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,都安排好了吗？我都打点好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything ready? I took care of everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.76,0:25:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天不能有闪失\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can not fail tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.22,0:25:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有了Glaber的支持…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Achieve the support glaber …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.92,0:25:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.98,0:25:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这么确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.95,0:26:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做了我们能做的 现在就交给众神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did our best, is now in the hands of the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.93,0:26:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.78,0:26:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那杯差劲的酒拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bring the wine horrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.23,0:26:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.54,0:26:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别给我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.58,0:26:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.35,0:26:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的训练马上开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon begins training day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.19,0:26:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.98,0:27:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟人 现在一整天都训练？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cock Jupiter! Now we train all day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.48,0:27:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还相信所有人能活到测试？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still believes that all survive to prove?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.82,0:27:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.45,0:27:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is still a fool, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.67,0:27:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus付钱买的他们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batiatus paid these men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.49,0:27:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就外表来看 没花多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very little the appearance of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.13,0:27:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马的生存之道就是钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way Roman lives for money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.49,0:27:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些人注定比其它人更有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some are worth more others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.25,0:27:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说有些色雷斯人很贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that some Thracian cost expensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看价格还在涨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the price rise even more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.42,0:27:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得我是新丁的时候 行走有多艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember how hard it was the march when he was recruiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.87,0:27:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定饿疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be mad with hunger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.94,0:27:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,填饱你们肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill your belly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.46,0:28:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.67,0:28:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要再寻死的时候告我一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake me in time to die again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.32,0:28:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物的事情我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize for the food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.88,0:28:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Barca那家伙只是搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barca think delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.89,0:28:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少没往里边撒尿 那样子更吃不下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not eat in this joint, is less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.06,0:28:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,日子会很艰难的 没有东西吃的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The days will be difficult. No food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.89,0:28:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就更惨了 你会给我你的面包？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always worse. Gave me your bread?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.16,0:28:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的？不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}My? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.63,0:28:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把东西从这搬到那 这只手转那只手 即使是墙外的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I move things from here to there, even outside these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.52,0:28:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要让什么 让我提供\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you need, Ashur can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.24,0:28:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not owe anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.29,0:29:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不求回报的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask nothing in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.82,0:29:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一关心的是你接下来几天的力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}My only concern is its strength in the coming days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.41,0:29:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有话直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how to escape from here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.64,0:29:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,几句话就说清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried once …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.63,0:29:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还提供其它服务 我让人下注\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other services I offer: probabilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.99,0:29:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁生谁死？多快多慢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who lives and who dies, how quickly or slowly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.01,0:29:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一天或什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}what day or time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.46,0:29:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛是用来消磨时间和金钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Games to spend time and money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.81,0:29:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呢？12：1的机率去矿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about give me? 12 To 1 in favor of mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.25,0:29:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,比死的机率高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highest to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.40,0:29:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你顶得住的话 Crixus会输一笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus lose much if it is against the numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.00,0:29:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看好你哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you, would not go so well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.98,0:29:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别认为我把你当朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not think I am your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.68,0:29:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not even think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.08,0:30:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么拿到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.62,0:30:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,下注呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defying odds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.79,0:30:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕会血本无归啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear they are about to get worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.49,0:31:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Glaber 叫我的官职 副将\N{\fnArial\fs30}, Glaber. Call me Legadus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.40,0:31:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个畜牲 老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even an animal … The mark of his race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.86,0:31:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪？谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she? Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.40,0:31:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小媳妇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.66,0:31:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪？我高兴在哪就在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? Where do I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.80,0:31:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没对你造成任何伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did him no harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.56,0:31:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}True. None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.47,0:31:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 你伤害了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you … You did me wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.89,0:31:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着辅助部队逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took auxiliaries desertion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.67,0:31:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,质疑我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}questioned my orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.04,0:31:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我在参议员面前颜面扫地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ruined my reputation Senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.87,0:31:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢 在竞技场 你再一次伤害了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, the Arena, hurt me again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.86,0:31:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我不能让你去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}not knowing when to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.45,0:31:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life, so …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.93,0:31:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,去换她\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.74,0:31:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的命已经不能用来谈条件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His life is no longer his to negotiate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.35,0:31:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要你去死 只要轻轻一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted to get her I need only whisper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.34,0:32:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Batiatus会下令的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the good Batiatus give the order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.10,0:32:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那在他耳边大叫命令呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then give the command in his ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误解了我 色雷斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has a misconception me, Thracian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.74,0:32:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 因为你的无礼我想让你去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}True. Ever wanted his death in exchange for their disrespect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.09,0:32:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我看到一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I that was a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.90,0:32:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不应该结束太快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would like to … It would be too fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.49,0:32:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我的愿望变得血腥了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now my desires turned to blood …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.72,0:32:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你的血一点点流干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poured drop by drop, until it is exhausted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.01,0:32:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你罗马的影响力很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him that the shadow of Rome was vast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.11,0:32:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死在这上面的 被撕成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}And die under it, piece by piece, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.26,0:32:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到人民的嘲笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}the roar of the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.84,0:32:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离别的恩惠 - 让你能记住我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A parting kindness … - To bind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.53,0:33:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从她大腿取下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took it from her thigh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.41,0:33:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保留这个气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}To preserve the scent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.91,0:33:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的手下用他们的气味玷污之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before my men to contaminate with their smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.14,0:33:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.92,0:33:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好玩呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was fun, 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.93,0:33:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她的眼里不再有斗志\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the fight finally let your eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.41,0:33:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用半块钱币\N{\fnArial\fs30}sold it for a Syrian unpleasant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.92,0:33:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把她卖给了叙利亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}currency by half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.07,0:33:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个色雷斯人终于认清 他在我面前的位置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thracian finally learned place in front of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.87,0:33:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.67,0:33:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,探访色雷斯人还满意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The visit to the Thracian satisfactory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.35,0:33:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个我不屑一顾的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man I do not care anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.56,0:33:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not talk more about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.23,0:33:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为您准备了宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepared a feast you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.10,0:33:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去罗马 罗马？现在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Postpartum to Rome. Rome? Now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.77,0:34:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅途中要点什么东西呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something for the trip, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.41,0:34:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不应该这么麻烦的 Lucretia\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should have been given work, Lucretia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.52,0:34:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些寻常小菜让我胃不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}These common dishes irritate my stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.77,0:34:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你夫君的时候 要不要来点酒呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a little wine? While we hope your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.61,0:34:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,花味的吗？不是 但尝起来一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flavored? No. But taste the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.08,0:34:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那来点水吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.97,0:34:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么热还有那些沙尘 是不是永远都不下雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heat and dust! It will rain again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.52,0:34:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can only pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.25,0:34:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一踏上卡普阿的街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can not put your feet the streets of Capua{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.22,0:34:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就听到有人在祈求老天下一点雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}without hearing someone begging to heaven by a drizzle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.79,0:34:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神还是无视我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet the gods ignore us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.62,0:34:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们做了触犯他们的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we did something that offended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.10,0:34:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天都有努力做点事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try to do a little something every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.13,0:34:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就是源头 Ilithyia\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're the cause, Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.20,0:34:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得收敛点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would stay away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.11,0:34:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,丘比特随时都能射出他的情箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter could launch a thunder at any time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.51,0:35:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得有所选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would have to choose between two targets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我是罗马女人中最守妇道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought being in the presence a Roman respectable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.36,0:35:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,守妇道这个词是男人发明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respectable is a word invented by men, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.78,0:35:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来奴役我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that seek to enslave us her.{\r}
