Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.29,0:46:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crixus！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.49,0:46:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.21,0:46:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}In position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.19,0:47:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一课 然后我会送你到来生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last lesson before sending it beyond that.{\r}
