Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.84,0:47:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是钱多人傻 就在此一举了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expensive and useless everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.26,0:47:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,打呀 色雷斯娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight, bitch Thracian.{\r}
