Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.19,0:48:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,小兔子吓到屁滚尿流了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rabbit is about to pee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.82,0:48:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了这只小兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the rabbit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.39,0:48:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.59,0:48:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,色雷斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thracians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.99,0:49:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一课学到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lesson was well learned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.99,0:49:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.79,0:49:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.39,0:49:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passed the test!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.95,0:49:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.79,0:50:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的生命从此有了意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life now meaningless. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.89,0:50:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swear to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.49,0:50:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,背诵角斗士的誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recite the oath Gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.39,0:50:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我的肉体 灵魂和意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offer my flesh, my mind and my will, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.59,0:50:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,献给伟大的Ludus\N{\fnArial\fs30}the glory of Ludus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.65,0:50:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听从我主人的命令 Batiatus\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the will of my master, Batiatus. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.39,0:50:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受烙印 束缚和挨打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accepted be burned, chained, beaten …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.15,0:50:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了誓言不惜生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}or die by that oath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.68,0:50:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了追求竞技场的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}In search of honor the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.97,0:50:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入兄弟会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the brotherhood.{\r}
